{"seq":1,"slug":"multimodal-ssl","title":"多模态自监督 CLIP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/applications/multimodal-ssl","wordCount":1692,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模态自监督-clip\">多模态自监督 CLIP</h1><p>把对比学习里「同一图的两个增强是正样本对」换成「一张图和它的文字描述是正样本对」，对比学习就从单模态跨进了多模态——这一步的产物 CLIP，可能是对比学习影响力最大的应用。它用四亿图文对学出的表示，无需为任何特定类别训练就能做零样本分类，并成为今天几乎所有多模态大模型的视觉编码器。这一篇讲跨模态对比的原理，以及它如何演进到 2025 年的 SigLIP 2 这类被旗舰多模态大模型用作视觉编码器的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CLIP（Contrastive Language-Image Pre-training）有两个独立的编码器：一个图像编码器、一个文本编码器，分别把图和文本映射到同一个共享的嵌入空间。训练目标是让配对的图文靠近、不配对的远离——这就是 <a href=\"../contrastive/contrastive-objectives\">对比损失与 InfoNCE</a> 的跨模态版本，只不过正样本对来自「图-文配对」而非「图-图增强」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[图像 batch] --&gt; B[图像编码器 → 图像向量]&#10;    C[文本 batch] --&gt; D[文本编码器 → 文本向量]&#10;    B --&gt; E[计算 N×N 相似度矩阵]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[对角线为正样本对]&#10;    F --&gt; G[行方向 softmax: 图配文]&#10;    F --&gt; H[列方向 softmax: 文配图]&#10;    G --&gt; I[对称 InfoNCE 损失]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[图像 batch] --&gt; B[图像编码器 → 图像向量]\n    C[文本 batch] --&gt; D[文本编码器 → 文本向量]\n    B --&gt; E[计算 N×N 相似度矩阵]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[对角线为正样本对]\n    F --&gt; G[行方向 softmax: 图配文]\n    F --&gt; H[列方向 softmax: 文配图]\n    G --&gt; I[对称 InfoNCE 损失]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"跨模态对比损失\">跨模态对比损失</h2><p>CLIP 的训练在一个批次内进行。设批次有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 对图文，图像编码出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{I_1,\\dots,I_N\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，文本编码出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{T_1,\\dots,T_N\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，计算所有图文对的相似度矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。对角线上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(I_i, T_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是真实配对（正样本），其余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2-N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个是负样本。损失是行、列两个方向的对称交叉熵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>CLIP</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">[</mo><msub><mtext>CE</mtext><mrow><mtext>img</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>txt</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CE</mtext><mrow><mtext>txt</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>img</mtext></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{CLIP}} = \\frac{1}{2}\\Big[\\text{CE}_{\\text{img}\\to\\text{txt}} + \\text{CE}_{\\text{txt}\\to\\text{img}}\\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CLIP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CE</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">img</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">txt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CE</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">txt</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">img</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个方向都是把对角元当正确类的 InfoNCE。这里的负样本来自批内其他图文对，所以 CLIP 同样需要大批量（原始 CLIP 用了 32768 的批量），这与 <a href=\"../contrastive/simclr-moco\">SimCLR 与 MoCo</a> 里 SimCLR 对批量的依赖同源。CLIP 也有可学习的温度系数控制相似度分布的尖锐度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"零样本能力从何而来\">零样本能力从何而来</h2><p>CLIP 最革命性的能力是零样本分类：给定一张图和一组类别名（如「猫」「狗」「飞机」），把每个类别名套进模板（「一张{类别}的照片」）编码成文本向量，再看图像向量和哪个文本向量最近，就完成了分类——完全不需要在这些类别上训练过。</p>\n<p>这种能力源于「自然语言监督」的开放性。传统监督分类的输出是固定的类别集合（ImageNet 的 1000 类），而 CLIP 学的是图像和任意文本的对齐，类别集合可以在推理时任意指定。文本不再是离散标签，而是一个连续、可组合的语义空间。这让 CLIP 的迁移性远超固定类别的监督模型，是它成为通用视觉编码器的根本原因，相关迁移协议见 <a href=\"transfer-finetuning\">迁移与微调</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-softmax-到-sigmoid-siglip\">从 Softmax 到 Sigmoid：SigLIP</h2><p>CLIP 的对比损失需要在整个批次上做 softmax 归一化，这要求批次内所有图文对的相似度都参与同一个分母，带来通信开销和对超大批量的依赖。SigLIP（Sigmoid Loss for Language-Image Pre-training）改用 Sigmoid 损失：把每个图文对独立地当成二分类（配对/不配对），不再需要全局 softmax 归一化。这让训练在小批量下也稳定，且更易扩展。</p>\n<p>下表对照三代关键的图文对比模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>损失</th>\n<th>关键特性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CLIP（2021）</td>\n<td>对称 softmax InfoNCE</td>\n<td>四亿图文对，零样本分类</td>\n<td>通用视觉编码器开山之作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SigLIP（2023）</td>\n<td>Sigmoid 二分类</td>\n<td>去全局归一化，小批量友好</td>\n<td>高效训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SigLIP 2（2025）</td>\n<td>Sigmoid + 自蒸馏 + 掩码</td>\n<td>多语言、稠密特征、定位增强</td>\n<td>新一代 VLM 的编码器基座（如 Qwen3-VL）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SigLIP 2（2025 年 2 月）在 Sigmoid 基础上加入了 caption 预训练、自蒸馏与掩码预测等自监督损失——把 <a href=\"../non-contrastive/masked-modeling\">掩码建模 MAE</a> 和 <a href=\"../non-contrastive/clustering-methods\">聚类方法 SwAV 与 DINO</a> 的思想融进了图文对比，在零样本分类、检索、定位与稠密预测上全面超越 SigLIP。它确实进入了旗舰多模态大模型：Qwen3-VL 的技术报告明确采用 SigLIP 2 架构作视觉编码器——默认 SigLIP2-SO-400M 变体、小尺寸模型用 SigLIP2-Large——并在官方预训练权重上继续训练动态分辨率；而 Gemma 3 沿用的仍是第一代 SigLIP 的 tailored 版本，并未升级到 SigLIP 2，具体选型不能一概而论（来源：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14786\">SigLIP 2 论文 arXiv:2502.14786</a>；<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.21631\">Qwen3-VL 技术报告 arXiv:2511.21631</a>；<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.19786\">Gemma 3 技术报告 arXiv:2503.19786</a>；HuggingFace <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog/siglip2\">SigLIP 2 博客</a>，2025）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"clip-作为多模态系统的基座\">CLIP 作为多模态系统的基座</h2><p>今天主流的多模态大语言模型，几乎都用一个对比预训练的视觉编码器（CLIP 系或 SigLIP 系）把图像变成 token，再喂给语言模型。这意味着对比学习的影响力远超分类本身——它是连接视觉和语言的标准接口。这种「冻结视觉编码器+对接 LLM」的范式，正是 <a href=\"transfer-finetuning\">迁移与微调</a> 里讨论的特征提取式迁移在多模态场景的体现，而把这类编码器推向更大规模的逻辑，见 <a href=\"scaling-foundation\">扩展与基础模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><p>跨模态对比把单模态的坑原样搬了过来，还多出几处新坑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只算行或只算列方向</td>\n<td>损失不对称，图→文与文→图对齐质量失衡</td>\n<td>CLIP 的损失是行列两个方向的对称交叉熵，缺一不可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在小批量上训练 CLIP</td>\n<td>批内负样本不足，对齐质量大幅下降</td>\n<td>跨模态负样本来自批内其他图文对，需大批量或改用 SigLIP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认为零样本必然弱于监督</td>\n<td>低估开放类别空间带来的迁移性</td>\n<td>零样本来自自然语言监督，类别可在推理时任意指定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把 SigLIP 2 当作所有 VLM 的默认编码器</td>\n<td>对具体选型做过度概括</td>\n<td>采用情况因模型而异，如 Qwen3-VL 用 SigLIP 2 而 Gemma 3 仍用第一代 SigLIP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个判断零样本能力来源的简单问法：模型的类别集合是训练时固定的，还是推理时可任意给出的？后者才具备开放词汇的迁移能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CLIP 把对比的正样本对从「图-图增强」换成「图-文配对」，用两个编码器对齐到共享嵌入空间，是对比学习最大的应用。</li>\n<li>损失是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 相似度矩阵上行列对称的 InfoNCE，依赖大批量提供负样本；零样本能力来自自然语言监督的开放类别空间。</li>\n<li>SigLIP 用 Sigmoid 二分类损失去掉全局 softmax，使小批量训练稳定且更易扩展。</li>\n<li>SigLIP 2（2025）融入自蒸馏与掩码等自监督损失，多语言、稠密特征更强；Qwen3-VL 采用 SigLIP 2 作视觉编码器，而 Gemma 3 沿用的仍是第一代 SigLIP。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模态自监督 CLIP","id":"多模态自监督-clip"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"跨模态对比损失","id":"跨模态对比损失"},{"level":2,"text":"零样本能力从何而来","id":"零样本能力从何而来"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Softmax 到 Sigmoid：SigLIP","id":"从-softmax-到-sigmoid-siglip"},{"level":2,"text":"CLIP 作为多模态系统的基座","id":"clip-作为多模态系统的基座"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"掩码建模 MAE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/non-contrastive/masked-modeling"},"next":{"title":"迁移与微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/applications/transfer-finetuning"}}